This module is another one that is directly embedded at the bottom of our infobox templates, in this case all of our media templates. It parses the values in the various release date fields, flagging any unreferenced release dates, and automatically applying the "Category:<Year> releases" category (or appropriate subcategory) depending on the value. It will also parse the date itself and use that value as a sortkey, so that the releases category for a given year will be sorted by the dates in which the media were released.